> **Level:** Upper-intermediate / Professional English  
> **Context:** Software Engineering, QA and Agile Delivery  
> **Format:** Vocabulary, grammar, pronunciation and speaking practice

This lesson develops the language needed to report progress, manage deadlines, communicate blockers and coordinate follow-ups in professional QA and software-engineering contexts. It includes answer keys, grammar explanations, Brazilian Portuguese pronunciation guides and speaking practice for daily stand-ups.

